1
00:00:00,895 --> 00:00:01,935
(Penny:)The Brady Bunch.

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:04,730
(Raj:)Okay.

3
00:00:04,899 --> 00:00:08,739
"Sammy Hagar replaced David Lee Roth
as the lead singer in what group?"

4
00:00:13,574 --> 00:00:15,454
(Sheldon(after they look at each other in confusion):)The Brady Bunch?

5
00:00:17,536 --> 00:00:18,576
(Penny:)Van Halen.

6
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:22,750
All right. "Madonna was married
to this Ridgemont High alum."

7
00:00:25,044 --> 00:00:27,294
(Penny:)Oh, my God. Sean Penn.

8
00:00:27,463 --> 00:00:29,843
(Leonard:)How do you know these things?

9
00:00:30,257 --> 00:00:33,637
(Penny:)I go outside and I talk to people.

10
00:00:34,929 --> 00:00:37,139
Okay, here.
"What actor holds the record...

11
00:00:37,306 --> 00:00:40,146
(Penny:)...for being named People magazine's
Sexiest Man Alive?"

12
00:00:40,476 --> 00:00:43,016
- William Shatner.
- Wait.

13
00:00:44,897 --> 00:00:46,687
(Leonard:)I don't think it's Shatner.

14
00:00:46,857 --> 00:00:49,147
Then it's gotta be Patrick Stewart.

15
00:00:51,904 --> 00:00:54,784
(Raj:)- No.
- Formal protest.

16
00:00:56,325 --> 00:00:59,495
All right. "Singer who sang
'Oops!... I Did It Again'?"

17
00:01:04,416 --> 00:01:05,876
(Raj:)Okay.

18
00:01:06,752 --> 00:01:09,542
"Tweety bird thought he saw a what?"

19
00:01:13,592 --> 00:01:15,512
(Sheldon(after they pass a smug look between each other):)Romulan.

20
00:01:19,056 --> 00:01:22,646
Yes. He thought he saw a Romulan.

21
00:01:24,853 --> 00:01:26,183
[PENNY SIGHS]

